cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use TorchSlicer in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "TorchSlicer: a split learning framework for PyTorch"
abstract: >-
  TorchSlicer partitions any PyTorch nn.Module into sequential slices and trains
  them in local simulation or across real devices (gRPC/TCP, centralized or P2P
  orchestration), for split learning and pipeline-parallel experiments.
authors:
